# Personal Portfolio Website

A responsive digital resume and portfolio built to highlight technical skills, projects, and professional background.

## Features
- **Hero/Profile Section:** Name, role title, and avatar placeholder.
- **About Me:** Brief introduction and professional background.
- **Skills Grid:** Visual layout showcasing core technical skills.
- **Projects Section:** Interactive cards with project descriptions and GitHub links.
- **Contact Area:** Integrated email link and social icons.
- **Smooth Navigation:** In-page smooth scrolling across all sections.

## Tech Stack
- HTML5
- CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid)
- Font Awesome (Icons) & Google Fonts (`Inter`)
